{"i":87,"text":"Briefs get tougher: the captain may ask for a certain picture or for the AI tool’s slogan.","where":"ui:gawa.how.arcade"},
{"i":88,"text":"A real person's face or voice needs their permission first. Use the Ask permission step, and listen to the answer.","where":"ui:gawa.how.consent"},
{"i":89,"text":"An artist's drawing needs the artist's name on it.","where":"ui:gawa.how.credit"},
{"i":90,"text":"Health facts must be correct. Wrong ones, even tempting ones, get the poster reported.","where":"ui:gawa.how.fact"},
{"i":91,"text":"Anything an AI made gets the \"Made with AI\" label.","where":"ui:gawa.how.label"},
{"i":92,"text":"There is no timer here. The Arcade version adds a clock, hearts and endless briefs.","where":"ui:gawa.how.module"},
{"i":93,"text":"Pick a picture, a slogan and a health fact. The poster builds as you pick.","where":"ui:gawa.how.parts"},
{"i":94,"text":"Make posters for Barangay Masagana, one brief after another. Publish before the clock ends (you can pause it). Every poster that gets reported costs a heart, and three hearts end the game.","where":"ui:gawa.introArcade"},
{"i":95,"text":"Bea's barangay needs health-drive posters. You will make three, one at a time. Each brief gives you a picture to try, a slogan and a health fact. Add the honest steps, then publish. A poster that skips a step gets reported, but you always finish.","where":"ui:gawa.introModule"},
